      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → fal → fal Settings**.\n2. Describe the product in **Product**, and name it in a few words in **Item**.\n3. Press **Run**. The enlarged photo and the transparent cut-out are saved under `image/fal`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        430,
        60
      ],
      "size": [
        400,
        96
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 1,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "text",
          "type": "STRING",
          "link": null,
          "widget": {
            "name": "text"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "FLUX.2 klein, the image node's default model, draws the product photo. Its `files` output passes the photo's fal link, its address on fal storage, on to **Upscale**.\n\nTo start from your own photo, add **Load Image** and connect it to **Upscale**'s `files` input. The pack uploads it to fal storage, so the model can read it."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        860,
        60
      ],
      "size": [
        400,
        96
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 2,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "text",
          "type": "STRING",
          "link": null,
          "widget": {
            "name": "text"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**File: Add** gives Topaz the photo as `image_url`, the field where it takes its image. Topaz enlarges the photo two times and keeps edges sharp, then saves it as a PNG. Raise `upscale_factor` in `arguments` up to 4 for print."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1290,
        60
      ],
      "size": [
        400,
