        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Bria Extract Object cuts out the object **Item** names. It returns two images: the cut-out and a black-and-white mask. **Get Item From List** takes the cut-out and its mask from `masks`, and **Join Image with Alpha** gives the cut-out back its transparency, so the saved PNG has a clear background."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
